# NOTE: dist/ is intentionally committed (not ignored). This package is consumed
# as a git dependency, and enterprise npm setups often set `ignore-scripts=true`,
# which skips the `prepare` build on install. Shipping a prebuilt dist/ makes the
# git dependency resolve unconditionally. Rebuild with `npm run build` before
# committing source changes (CI `verify` enforces it).

